@startuml C4_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_Deployment
title C4 - Plan Generation (Logical Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "Operator Device" as Device {
  artifact "Angular SPA\n(Operation Plans Module)" as Spa
}

node "OEM API Node" as OemNode {
  artifact "OperationPlanController" as Controller
  artifact "OperationPlanService" as PlanService
  artifact "OEM DB" as Store
}

cloud "Identity Platform" as Identity {
  artifact "OIDC Authority" as Oidc
}

cloud "TodoApi Platform" as TodoApi {
  artifact "VVN Catalog API" as VvnApi
}

cloud "Resource Platform" as Resources {
  artifact "Resources API"
  artifact "Staff API"
  artifact "Storage Areas API"
}

Operator --> Spa : HTTPS (Browser)
Spa --> Controller : POST preview/generate/missing
Controller --> Oidc : Validate tokens
PlanService --> Store : Read/write plans + tasks
PlanService --> VvnApi : Fetch approved VVNs
PlanService --> Resources : Fetch resources/staff/storage
Spa --> Resources : Fetch metadata for UI

@enduml
